(7702318, 1264619, 67258, '<td valign="top">Done many times, but here done well.  The textural detail of the table adds additional interest, and adds a further shadows element, as does the triangle of black negative space.</td>', 'Done many times, but here done well.  The textural detail of the table adds additional interest, and adds a further shadows element, as does the triangle of black negative space.', '2021-10-01 04:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702319, 1264614, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love the depth offend clarity of the shadows against those glorious rich autumnal colours.</td>', 'I love the depth offend clarity of the shadows against those glorious rich autumnal colours.', '2021-10-01 04:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702321, 1264638, 67258, '<td valign="top">A fascinating image with lots to delight.  I love that the shadows of the railings all pull the viewers eye into the bicycle and only from there to the shadow of the basket and wheel - like a cherry on top of a bun (or perhaps  a chocolate chip hidden inside is a better analogy). Really, very good.</td>', 'A fascinating image with lots to delight.  I love that the shadows of the railings all pull the viewers eye into the bicycle and only from there to the shadow of the basket and wheel - like a cherry on top of a bun (or perhaps  a chocolate chip hidden inside is a better analogy). Really, very good.', '2021-10-01 04:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702324, 1264640, 67258, '<td valign="top">Despite your title, there is somethings, melancholy, yearning about this photo.  I get more of a sense of a prison - both physical and metaphorical - from which the subject is viewing the world from.  Whilst deeper shadows would have added drama, I like this softer, subtler approach.</td>', 'Despite your title, there is somethings, melancholy, yearning about this photo.  I get more of a sense of a prison - both physical and metaphorical - from which the subject is viewing the world from.  Whilst deeper shadows would have added drama, I like this softer, subtler approach.', '2021-10-01 05:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702325, 1264599, 67258, '<td valign="top">Your upwards pod works well, adding to the mystery and enhancing the shadows.</td>', 'Your upwards pod works well, adding to the mystery and enhancing the shadows.', '2021-10-01 05:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702327, 1264330, 67258, '<td valign="top">Still there, but from the shadow, only just.  A really fascinating image and very well composed.</td>', 'Still there, but from the shadow, only just.  A really fascinating image and very well composed.', '2021-10-01 05:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
